# Pinned validation fixtures are hashed byte-for-byte (SHA256SUMS). Keep every
# hashed file free of end-of-line normalization so the checksums stay stable
# across platforms (notably Windows CRLF checkout, which otherwise breaks the
# digest). SHA256SUMS covers both the fixtures/ payload and the generator
# script one level up, so both are pinned here.
inst/validation/fixtures/** -text
inst/validation/generate-ws9-16-tensorpac.py -text
